        <outline text="Kicking the tires. This is nice and it reminds me of something... 🥁" created="Sat, 21 Nov 2026 16:24:51 GMT"/>
        <outline text="Listening to The Cakekitchen [Time Flowing Backwards](https://thecakekitchen.bandcamp.com/album/time-flowing-backwards) after having gone down a Graeme Jefferies rabbit hole while stuck in the Atlanta airport during The Great Ground Stop of 2026. ![The Cakekitchen: Time Flowing Backwards](/images/2026/11/a2894995489-10-21113905.jpg)" created="Sat, 21 Nov 2026 16:26:42 GMT"/>
        <outline text="[Camper](https://apps.apple.com/us/app/camper-for-bandcamp/id6822102958) is such a better iOS app for listening to Bandcamp than the Bandcamp app." created="Sat, 21 Nov 2026 16:29:18 GMT"/>
